    skos:definition "Enforces audit/review report pattern. Two acceptable forms: lowercase + underscore + 3-part SemVer (PR1-PR8 pattern: oee_methodology_audit_v1_0_0.md), or capitalised + underscore + 3-part SemVer (review pattern: OEEcosystem_Review_v1_0_0.md). Regex: ^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*_v\\d+_\\d+_\\d+\\.md$."@en ;
    skos:example "oee_methodology_audit_v1_0_0.md ✅ ; OEEcosystem_Review_v1_0_0.md ✅ ; workstream_map_and_next_step_v1_0_0.md ✅"@en .

