    skos:definition "Measurement score: OEE v3.0.0 — Competency Question Source Traceability Score. Per Sprint F1 (Track A4 type-redirect from quality:Score → measurement:Score), oe-measurement SHACL requires skos:definition on Score individuals."@en .

<http://example.org/oqc-measurements-v17/Score_oee_v3_0_0_OEE_VersionHistoryDepth> a measurement:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "OEE v3.0.0 — Version History Documentation Depth Score"@en ;
    measurement:derivedFromMetric quality:I_OEE_VersionHistoryDepth ;
    measurement:hasConfidenceTier measurement:Tier_A_StaticAlgorithmic ;
