    rdfs:seeAlso <https://oops.linkeddata.es/catalogue.jsp> ;
    skos:definition "A cycle between two classes in a hierarchy is included in the ontology. A cycle appears when some class A has a subclass (directly or indirectly) B, and at the same time B is a superclass (directly or indirectly) of A."@en .

