    skos:definition "Per-release SHACL shape set validating: (a) every top-level class in subject ontology N hangs under N's intended root or under an explicit umbrella; (b) every owl:ObjectProperty declares rdfs:domain AND rdfs:range or carries an explicit 'intentionally polymorphic' annotation; (c) classes flagged as potentially-dead are reviewed at MINOR-bump checkpoints."@en .

