<http://example.org/oqc-measurements#TR_CR_domain_3> a measurement:RoleAwareThresholdRow,
        measurement:ThresholdRow,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ClassRichness × domain → 3/5 if 0.0..0.1"@en ;
    measurement:appliesToMetric quality:ClassRichness ;
    measurement:appliesToRole "domain" ;
    measurement:lowerBound 0.0 ;
    measurement:oquareScore 3 ;
    measurement:upperBound 0.1 ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://example.org/measurement> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/oqc-measurements> ;
    skos:definition "OQuaRE band 3/5 for metric ClassRichness when applied to a domain ontology. Values in [0.0, 0.1) receive this band score. Per Duque-Ramos et al. (2011) §3.4 OQuaRE Table 4. Label: \"ClassRichness × domain → 3/5 if 0.0..0.1\". skos:definition synthesized in Sprint F2 (2026-05-14) per L-47v2 path (a) — the source class had no skos:definition requirement, but the canonical measurement: home may; supplied here from existing data."@en .

