        "2026-10-12T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:publisher oe-prov:Org_IKU_Department_of_ComputerEngineering ;
    dcterms:rights "Copyright (c) 2025-2026 a university & the method author. Licensed under CC BY 4.0." ;
    dcterms:rightsHolder oe-prov:Org_IKU_Department_of_ComputerEngineering ;
    dcterms:title "OE Method — A-Box (one file for the package)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The A-Box of the OE Method's domain vocabularies as ONE file (BP-D54): the ten vocabulary A-Boxes, each a module (an untyped resource at its former ontology IRI carrying the old header's statements). Every named subject says dcterms:isPartOf <its module>. A pure union, proved. The governance data (knowledge base, release history, provenance registry, lineage backlogs) is a unit of its own."@en ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/oemethod/1.0.0>,
        <http://example.org/oemethod/1.1.0>,
        <http://example.org/oemethod/1.2.0> ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/oemethod/1.3.0> ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.3.0" ;
    skos:changeNote "v1.1.0 (2026-10-06): re-derived after the governing pack corrected three individuals of the reliability module whose rdf:type named a class the pack never declares; their canonical home is the risk module, named by the declared domain of the very properties those individuals carry. Only the type claim changed, and only in that module."@en,
        "v1.2.0 (2026-10-11): re-derived after the governing package changed 3 module(s): http://example.org/measurement, http://example.org/quality, http://example.org/reliability. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.3.0 (2026-10-12): re-derived after the governing package changed 1 module(s): http://example.org/measurement. Nothing else changed."@en .

