        "risk ABox v3.1.3 (PATCH) — F-SH2 fix (release_check_v2_0_0.py rewrite, KNOWN_FINDINGS_v20_37_0.md). v3.1.2 added riskImpact/riskLikelihood/riskStatus as free-text literals, satisfying the then-checked RISK-ITEM-V1 shape (presence-only) but not the TBox's own declaration of these as owl:ObjectProperty with a class range — an object/datatype-property confusion the earlier shape could not see. Test-driven per L-78: a shape-side nodeKind guard was tried first and empirically failed (reproduced 2 violations + 3 warnings, worse than the 1 violation + 3 warnings it started with, since SHACL constraint components are independent and a NodeKind violation adds rather than replaces). Fixed the data instead: relinked RiskItem_HermitRetargetMitigated to existing controlled-vocabulary individuals (risk:Unlikely, risk:Medium_Impact, risk:Mitigated); narrative preserved verbatim as rdfs:comment. Verified: risk_shapes_astrea_v1_1_0.ttl 1 violation + 3 warnings -> 0 violations, 0 warnings."@en,
        "risk_abox v3.0.1 (PATCH) per v17.28.0 industrial-hardening — added CC BY 4.0 license, copyright, publisher/rightsHolder (IKÜ Computer Engineering), PROV-O wasGeneratedBy + wasAttributedTo (the method author). Additive ontology metadata only — no semantic changes."@en,
