        "quality ABox v5.7.0 (MINOR) per v17.33.0 Option E — added QualityCriterion, QualityThreshold, NormalizationRule, GateDecision, Recommendation instances populating 5 unused DT props per L-49. 5 remaining DT props (coverageRatio, missingCount, notes, threshold, weight) DEFERRED to Option G — they have ambiguous blank-node domains better suited to deprecation than ABox population."@en,
